From 2c5bc49d9e167e01b5b4eeb93038bfca02ce0b28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:08:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix(motion): cut floor of a re-entry is the whole disc,
 cut earlier

"Already cut" now means: the moves posted before the re-entry (earlier in
the program order), at or below its depth, sweep the whole tool disc
round the plunge point (the centre, a ring at half a radius and the rim
each within one tool radius of an earlier cut's centre path). A disc cut
only in part does not count.

Pins: outside_reentry_onto_a_partly_cut_disc_is_refused,
outside_reentry_onto_floor_cut_later_is_refused.

Refs #3884

